WEBVTT

00:13:59.379 --> 00:14:00.974
nzuri sana. Nafasi hapa yapunguzwa,

00:14:01.824 --> 00:14:04.382
na watu milioni saba kando yangu.

00:14:04.823 --> 00:14:08.092
Tusipochukua hatu sasa, 
na tuchukue hatua pamoja,

00:14:08.116 --> 00:14:11.496
itatulazimu tutengeneze nafasi
ya watu bilioni moja

00:14:11.520 --> 00:14:13.587
kabla ya mwisho wa karne hii.

00:14:13.960 --> 00:14:16.365
Na hili ni jukwaa kubwa.

00:14:16.841 --> 00:14:18.801
Lakini hakuna nafasi ya ziada.

00:14:18.825 --> 00:14:19.992
Asanteni.

00:14:20.016 --> 00:14:24.888
(Makofi)